      "id": 1,
      "text": "Polish Hill rises steeply above the Allegheny River, its dramatic topography shaping the neighborhood’s character.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wonderfulmuseums.com/museum/polish-hill-river-church-museum/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Polish Hill earned its name when waves of Polish immigrants settled there in the mid‑1800s to work in Pittsburgh’s steel mills.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_Hill",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Immaculate Heart of Mary Church, completed in 1905, towers over Polish Hill and remains one of Pittsburgh’s tallest Roman Catholic churches.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://steelcityhistory.com/2025/02/28/the-story-of-polish-hill/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sixteen flights of city steps weave through Polish Hill, linking pedestrians to public transit and preserving the area’s historic walkability.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polish_Hill",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Polish Hill River Church Museum curates artifacts from the immigrant era, making the neighborhood a living testament to its heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wonderfulmuseums.com/museum/polish-hill-river-church-museum/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Polish Hill shares a corner with Bloomfield, meeting at the Bloomfield Bridge that connects two historic Pittsburgh districts.",
